ChatGPT said:
Bilkul. Main tumhare liye complete handoff documentation bana raha hoon jise kal kisi naye GPT/chat ko dekar woh bina purani conversation dekhe project samajh sake.

Isme backend architecture, routes, authentication flow, admin system, frontend final structure, development phases, API mapping aur important rules sab included hain.

Email SaaS — Final Project Documentation
