app.use(
  cors({
    origin: [
      "http://localhost:5173",
      "http://localhost:5174",
    ],
    credentials: true,
  }),
);

Admin frontend ke .env me:

VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

4. Backend Main Routes
Backend me main route structure:

/api/auth
/api/profile
/api/projects
/api/templates
