34. Admin Frontend Authentication Flow
/admin/login
       ↓
AdminLogin.jsx
       ↓
POST /api/auth/login
       ↓
Access Token
       ↓
Get User
       ↓
Check role
       ↓
role === "admin"
       ↓
Save auth state
       ↓
/admin/dashboard

Agar normal user login kare:

role !== "admin"
       ↓
403 / Access Denied
       ↓
Admin Dashboard allowed nahi

