40. Important Security Rules
Admin frontend me:

Password kabhi store nahi karna.
password ❌

API key secret expose nahi karna.
Backend already:

.select("-keyHash")

use kar raha hai.

Access token ke saath API request:
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

hona chahiye.

Refresh token
HTTP-only cookie me hai.

Frontend directly refresh token access nahi karega.

