adminAuth

banane ki zarurat nahi.

Existing:

/api/auth/login

use hoga.

Existing:

authMiddleware
+
adminMiddleware

admin security handle karenge.

Sirf local development ke liye CORS me:

"http://localhost:5174"

add karna hai.

