43. Most Important Rule for Future Development
Aage code banate waqt existing backend API contracts ko follow karna hai.

Frontend apni taraf se naye endpoint names invent nahi karega.

Example:

Backend:

GET /api/admin-dashboard/admin/overview

Frontend exactly isi endpoint ko call karega.

Backend:

PUT /api/admin-dashboard/admin/users/:id/status

to frontend isi ko use karega.

